OL,3,AGig evacuation quarantine was
OL,4,Atraumatic, fans say
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome Don Toliver fans who were
OL,7,Fevacuated from Manchester's Co-op Live
OL,8,Farena after an unknown substance was
OL,9,Freleased have said they were
OL,10,F"quarantined for six hours" and
OL,11,Fthreatened with arrest if they did not
OL,12,Fremove all their clothing.
OL,14,FJordan, 33, from Scotland, said he and
OL,15,Fhis brothers were among 88 people who
OL,16,Fwere taken for decontamination after
OL,17,Fthe incident at the gig on Sunday
OL,18,Fnight, and it "felt like I was being
OL,19,Ftaken hostage".
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
