OL,3,AGig evacuation quarantine was
OL,4,Atraumatic, fans say
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said they had asked for medical help
OL,7,Fat 22:15 GMT and were taken to the
OL,8,FEtihad Stadium, where they were made to
OL,9,Fchange into paper suits, and stayed
OL,10,Funtil 04:45 on Monday.
OL,12,F"It was so traumatic," Jordan said.
OL,13,FGreater Manchester Police declined to
OL,14,Fcomment.
